  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A dog walks along a horizontal, straight road. The speed of the dog, <em>v</em>, varies with time, <em>t </em>as shown on the graph below.</p>\n\n<figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure>\n\n<p>What is the acceleration of the dog at t = 8 s and what is the distance travelled by the dog during the final four seconds of its motion?</p>\n\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Acceleration at </strong><strong><em>t</em></strong><strong> = 8 s</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Distance travelled during final four seconds of motion</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"A\">\n<td><strong>A.</strong></td>\n<td>0.5 m s<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-2}\"></span></td>\n<td>4 m</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"B\">\n<td><strong>B.</strong></td>\n<td>2.0 m s<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-2}\"></span></td>\n<td>4 m</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"C\">\n<td><strong>C.</strong></td>\n<td>0.5 m s<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-2}\"></span></td>\n<td>16 m</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"D\">\n<td><strong>D.</strong></td>\n<td>2.0 m s<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-2}\"></span></td>\n<td>16 m</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>"
  },
